<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Davids sees flat first half profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Davids sees flat first half profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grocery wholesaler and retailer Davids Ltd said on Monday it expects the first half of the 1996/97 financial to be flat but sees profit growth coming in the second half of the year.</p>
</text>
